sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant M as Match service
  participant DB as MongoDB Atlas
  participant T as Scheduler
  C->>M: Submit turn with expected number/digest
  M->>DB: Validate version and persist immutable replay event
  M-->>C: Canonical snapshot and next actor
  T->>M: Due deadline task
  M->>DB: Apply default/forfeit once
  M-->>C: Result or next turn
